---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="现在" description="宫水最近在做什么。">
  <section class="page container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">NOW</p>
      <h1 class="serif">现在</h1>
      <p class="page-sub">最后更新：2026 年 10 月</p>
    </header>
    <div class="now-list">
      <div class="now-item">
        <h2>在做</h2>
        <p>给这个站点添砖加瓦，把页脚之外的地方一点点填满。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="now-item">
        <h2>在读</h2>
        <p>一本关于水与城市的书，还没读完，先不报书名。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="now-item">
        <h2>在学</h2>
        <p>怎么把东西做得更慢一点、更少一点。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .now-list { display: grid; gap: 36px; max-width: 560px; }
  .now-item h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .04em; color: var(--ink); }
  .now-item p { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; color: var(--ink-soft); }
</style>
